+# Housing research report
+
+## Final criteria
+
+The hard screen is: exactly two bedrooms; cats allowed; available for an **October 15, 2026 lease start**; and a scheduled weekday transit trip of no more than 35 minutes to Lakeview Medical Center. The comparison reports base rent plus mandatory recurring monthly charges for a one-cat household. Optional parking is reported but excluded from the recurring total. Qualifying homes are ranked first by shorter transit commute and then by the preference for in-unit laundry. The packet distinguishes recurring charges from one-time deposits (sources/listings.md:3), and the commute file uses a common 7:30 a.m. weekday departure (sources/transit_times.csv:1).
+
