+
+The rank is intentionally commute-first: Alder’s 31-minute trip leads Harbor at 33, Fulton at 34, and Grove at the 35-minute ceiling. Fulton’s in-unit laundry does not move it above Harbor because laundry is the secondary preference. Parking did not change rank because it is optional.
